Not included
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party image assets are included. The scripts in scripts/ can build
local art packs from Star Office UI or from LimeZu's "Modern Interiors" and
"Modern Office" that you obtained yourself; those licences forbid
redistribution, so the results are written to packs/local/, which is ignored by
git and excluded from Docker images.
